                                "example_id": "bb50b897-9337-4445-854c-d9926ee911a4",
                                "sense_id": "14d0f071-b603-321b-be0c-4130a4372b28",
                                "text": "'It's a bit ick, to be honest, but Rochelle thought it would be funny. Last year we did dragon's diarrhoea, with Tia Maria and chocolate Angel Delight, but nobody would touch it.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a98c138-b70d-4232-b779-aa23e0e66855",
                                "sense_id": "14d0f071-b603-321b-be0c-4130a4372b28",
                                "text": "He thought she would be an embarrassment. That kind of made me feel a bit ick."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81b16678-e511-416e-8676-4651b0b4921f",
                                "sense_id": "14d0f071-b603-321b-be0c-4130a4372b28",
                                "text": "There's nothing “ick” about him, but I'm not sure how to say that without sounding like I'm reciting lines from that terrible bodice ripper I took on Theo's practice date."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
